Geany Agent Plugin
==================

Adds an AI agent terminal tab to the Geany message window.

The configured command (default: `claude`) is started inside the user's
login shell so that PATH and profile scripts are honoured.  The process is
restarted automatically when it exits.

Requirements
------------
  * Geany >= 2.1
  * libvte-2.91 >= 0.48  (package: libvte-2.91-dev on Debian/Ubuntu)

Configuration
-------------
Open Edit → Plugin Preferences → Agent to change the command.
The setting is stored in:
  ~/.config/geany/plugins/geanyagent/geanyagent.conf

Known Issues
------------
None currently known.

